              "say": "needed",
              "fa": "لازم بود — wanted, painted, decided",
              "words": "started · fitted · handed · waited"
            },
            {
              "ip": "/t/",
              "sub": "after unvoiced",
              "say": "walked",
              "fa": "راه رفت — p, k, f, s, th, ch, sh",
